@startuml
title Deployment Diagram - BrewLite (Production target: Vercel + Render + Neon + GHCR)

' ============================================================
' Nguồn sự thật cho sơ đồ này:
'   - backend/Dockerfile          (multi-stage, ENTRYPOINT docker-entrypoint.sh, EXPOSE 3001)
'   - frontend/Dockerfile         (Next.js standalone, EXPOSE 3000)
'   - backend/docker-entrypoint.sh (prisma migrate deploy -> db seed -> node dist/main.js)
'   - docker-compose.yml          (4 service + healthcheck, dùng cho local/CI)
'   - docs/architecture/overview.md §4 (triển khai)
'   - GET /health                 (app.controller.ts)
' Phương án nền tảng là ĐỀ XUẤT, cập nhật khi nhóm chốt platform khác.
' ============================================================

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultTextAlignment center
skinparam roundcorner 6
skinparam ArrowColor #2C3E50
skinparam nodeBorderColor #2C3E50
skinparam componentBorderColor #2C3E50
skinparam databaseBorderColor #2C3E50

' ---------- Tác nhân & ranh giới môi trường ----------

actor "Khách hàng\n(trình duyệt / PWA)" as user
actor "Nhân viên pha chế\n(/barista)" as barista
actor "Giảng viên / Dev\n(kiểm tra)" as dev

node "Lập trình viên (máy local)" as local {
  node "Docker Desktop" as localDocker {
    component "docker compose up --build\n(postgres + adminer +\nbackend + frontend)" as localStack
  }
}

cloud "Internet / HTTPS" as internet

node "GitHub" as github {
  component "Repository\nmain / feature/*" as repo
  component "GitHub Actions\nci.yml (CI)\ncd.yml (CD)" as actions
  component "GHCR\nghcr.io/<org>/brewlite-api\nghcr.io/<org>/brewlite-web" as ghcr
}

' ---------- Production ----------

node "Vercel (Edge + Serverless)" as vercel {
  component "Next.js 15 — Web/PWA\nnext build (standalone)\nHTTPS + CDN\nEnv: NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL" as web
}

node "Render (Docker Runtime)" as render {
  component "NestJS API container\nimage: ghcr.io/<org>/brewlite-api:<sha>\nENTRYPOINT docker-entrypoint.sh\nmigrate deploy → seed → node dist/main.js\nPORT 3001 (chỉ nhận traffic HTTPS từ Render proxy)" as api
  component "GET /health\n→ 200 {status, uptime, service}" as health
}

node "Neon (Managed PostgreSQL 16)" as neon {
  database "PostgreSQL 16\nschema: public\nSSL bắt buộc\nKhông public ra Internet,\nchỉ API nối bằng DATABASE_URL" as db
  database "pgbouncer\n(connection pool)" as pool
}

node "Secret / Env của platform" as secrets {
  artifact "JWT_SECRET\nDATABASE_URL\nCORS_ORIGIN\nTHROTTLE_TTL / THROTTLE_LIMIT" as envs
}

' ---------- Luồng ----------

user --> web : HTTPS 443
barista --> web : HTTPS 443
dev --> web : kiểm tra URL prod
dev --> api : /api-docs, /health

localStack ..> repo : git pull

repo --> actions : push / pull_request / tag
actions --> ghcr : build & push image (tag = commit SHA)
actions --> api : deploy hook (Render)
actions --> web : deploy hook (Vercel)
actions ..> health : smoke test sau deploy

web --> api : HTTPS\nfetch JSON + Bearer JWT\nNEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL
api --> db : TCP 5432 (TLS)\nPrisma Client
db -down- pool : pool kết nối

envs --> api : nạp khi khởi động
envs --> web : build-time NEXT_PUBLIC_*

api --> health : healthcheck 30s

note right of api
  Không mở port 5432 ra ngoài.
  CORS_ORIGIN chỉ chứa domain Vercel.
  Mọi lỗi trả JSON chuẩn + X-Request-Id.
end note

note bottom of ghcr
  Tag: <commit-sha> (nguồn sự thật để rollback)
  Rollback = deploy lại image của SHA trước
  hoặc "Redeploy" bản release trước đó trên Render.
end note

note bottom of actions
  CI (ci.yml): lint → test → build (đã có)
  CD (cd.yml): build image → push GHCR
             → trigger deploy (staging → prod)
             → smoke test /health
end note

' ---------- Ranh giới môi trường ----------

package "Môi trường" {
  node "Local" as envLocal
  node "CI (GitHub Actions runner)" as envCI
  node "Production" as envProd
}

envLocal ..> localStack : Docker
envCI ..> actions
envProd ..> render
envProd ..> vercel
envProd ..> neon

legend right
  | Thành phần | Nền tảng đề xuất | Ghi chú |
  | Web (PWA) | Vercel | HTTPS + CDN tự động, Next.js native |
  | API | Render Web Service (Docker) | Image từ GHCR, health check /health |
  | DB | Neon PostgreSQL 16 | Serverless, free tier, SSL bắt buộc |
  | Registry | GHCR | Miễn phí, dùng GITHUB_TOKEN |
  | Secret | Env của platform | Không commit, không log |
endlegend

@enduml
